<Slide style={{width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '0px', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei'}}><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 88, left: 60, width: 360, height: 556, background: '#0E3F8C', padding: 21, gap: 17}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 33, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>汇报提纲</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#AFC9F0', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>CONTENTS</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.4, textAlign: 'left' }}>沿「问题 → 方法 → 过程 → 原理」四步，把四类决策如何被求解讲清楚。</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#C9DCF7', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.4, textAlign: 'left' }}>本 deck 只讲方法：不写实验数字，不写「优于某方法」的对比宣称；公式与模块名均可回溯论文方法章与代码实现。</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#AFC9F0', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>全篇 19 页 · 约 15–20 分钟</Text></Box><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 88, left: 436, width: 784, height: 556, gap: 12}}><Box style={{width: 784, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 10, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14, alignItems: 'center'}}><Box style={{width: 58, minHeight: 58, background: '#1E4FA8', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'center' }}>01</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 660, gap: 4}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 23, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>任务分配：问题与决策</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>五个前提同时不成立、四类决策 y / x / π / z、完成是约束成本是目标</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>P3–P5</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{width: 784, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 10, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14, alignItems: 'center'}}><Box style={{width: 58, minHeight: 58, background: '#1E4FA8', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'center' }}>02</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 660, gap: 4}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 23, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>方法：两阶段分层与滚动闭环</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>分层动机、总体框架、第一阶段动态任务选择、跨周期状态继承</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>P6–P9</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{width: 784, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 10, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14, alignItems: 'center'}}><Box style={{width: 58, minHeight: 58, background: '#1E4FA8', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'center' }}>03</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 660, gap: 4}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 23, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>第二阶段：选择性 MUAS 求解过程</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>九环节链条、编码与逆映射、解码修复链、终点机巢、评价与精修</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>P10–P14</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{width: 784, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 10, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14, alignItems: 'center'}}><Box style={{width: 58, minHeight: 58, background: '#1E4FA8', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'center' }}>04</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 660, gap: 4}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 23, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>第二阶段的原理与边界</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>谁进搜索空间、为什么用精确解、覆盖门禁口径、诊断到机制的映射</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>P15–P18</Text></Box></Box></Box></Slide>